// JSON body ceiling for the LLM wire surfaces (/v1, /v1beta, /mcp, Ollama
// /api/*). Vision requests inline base64 images (~33% inflation over the raw
// bytes; google.ts alone forwards images up to 8MB, ~10.7MB in base64), so a
